    <p>Kenya is a beautiful country located in East Africa. It is known around the world for its wildlife, beautiful beaches, mountains, national parks and rich cultural heritage.</p>
    <p>Tourism is an important part of life in Kenya. Visitors come from different parts of the world to experience the country's natural beauty and learn about its people and traditions.</p>
    <p>From the beaches of Mombasa and Diani to the wildlife of Maasai Mara and Amboseli, Kenya offers many different experiences for tourists.</p>
        <h2>Why Visit Kenya?</h2>
        <p>Kenya offers many activities for visitors. A tourist can enjoy a wildlife safari in the morning, visit a cultural village in the afternoon and relax at the beach in the evening.</p>
        <p>The country also has beautiful landscapes including mountains, forests, lakes, grasslands and the Indian Ocean coastline.</p>
        <h2>Adventure Awaits</h2>
        <p>Kenya is a destination for people who enjoy adventure. Visitors can go on safari, hiking, camping, bird watching, swimming, diving and many other activities.</p>
        <p>Whether you are travelling alone, with friends or with your family, Kenya has many places to explore.</p>

